# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
# --- this checkout's own artifacts ----------------------------------------
# Runtime output of a bare-metal run: uploads/embeddings (DATA_PATH) and the
# log directory the container mounts from infra/logs. Both are bind mounts in
# the stack and neither belongs in a commit.
/data/
/logs/

# A local virtualenv. 'make env' and the README both create one here.
/venv/
/.venv/

# The dump the image NEEDS is tracked on purpose: database/HireSnap.sql, loaded
# by service/infrastructure/database/schema.py on INIT_DB. Any .sql file sitting
# at the backend ROOT is somebody's local export and may hold production rows,
# which is why the pattern is anchored (/*.sql) and the dump in database/ is
# simply not matched.
/*.sql

# Local exports and one-off scratch files that used to live at the root of this
# service. The refactor removed the paths that produced most of them (src/ no
# longer exists) but the patterns stay, because an .ipynb dropped next to the
# package is exactly what the layout rules forbid (.scripts/check_ml_boundary.py
# fails a loose notebook at the backend root).
/files/
/SQL.txt
/main_stuff.py
/main_stuff.ipynb
/urls.txt
/setup.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# Model weights: multi-gigabyte, licence-bound, and now mounted read-only into
# the ml sidecar instead of being trained here. The pattern remains so that a
# weights directory appearing in this tree can never be staged by accident.
/pretrained_ckpts/
/weights/
service/certs/
*.pem
*.key
